# Frontend Conventions

## Structure
- Views in `frontend/src/views/` — one feature per `*View.vue`
- Shared UI in `components/`; logic in `composables/`
- API paths only via `ApiPaths` in `api/paths.js` — no scattered strings

## CRUD page pattern
```js
const { showForm, editing, form, openCreate, openEdit, closeForm } = useEntityForm(blankForm, { onReset: clearErrors })
```
- Wrap form in `<FormHost :show="showForm" @close="closeForm">`
- Desktop: hide list when form open (`v-show="!showForm || isMobile"`)
- Page title switches in desktop form mode via computed `pageTitle`

## API
- `api/client.js` attaches Bearer token; 401 → logout redirect
- Use `trySubmit` from `useFormValidation` for field-level API errors
- **Form selects:** `useLookupsStore().getAccounts()` / `getCostTypes()` → `/api/lookups/*` by default
- **Admin CRUD lists:** pass `{ admin: true }` to hit full `/accounts` / `/cost-types` APIs
- Transaction attachments: `ApiPaths.incomeTransactionAttachment(id, attachmentId)` / `costTransactionAttachment(...)`

## Transaction attachments (income/cost)
- Permissions (no nav): `attachments.view` (list + preview), `attachments.add` (upload), `attachments.delete` (remove saved)
- **List:** `DocumentAttachmentList` only when `attachments.view`
- **Form:** `TransactionAttachmentsField` with `canView` / `canAdd` / `canDelete`
- **Preview:** `DocumentPreview` — image/PDF in modal (desktop) / bottom sheet (mobile)
- Edit mode: load `item.attachments` **after** `openEdit()` (not before — `onReset` clears them)
- Delete saved attachment in edit: immediate `DELETE` API; sync list row via `onExistingAttachmentsChange`
- Pending files: removed locally until form save
- Paths: `ApiPaths.incomeTransactionAttachment(id, attachmentId)` / `costTransactionAttachment(...)`

## Mobile overlay back (required for overlays)
Any mobile full-screen overlay, sheet, or preview **must** handle hardware/gesture back and top-bar back:
- Use `useOverlayBack(isOpen, requestClose, { enabled, stateKey })` from `composables/useOverlayBack.js`
- `AppTopBar` calls `closeActiveOverlay()` before form back
- `FormHost` `onPopState`: skip if `hasActiveOverlay()`; only close form when `!history.state?.appForm`
- Register overlay in `activeOverlay` so top bar shows back on primary tabs when preview is open

## Auth & permissions
```js
auth.hasPermission('accounts.create')
auth.hasAnyPermission('users.update', 'users.delete')
```
Router: `meta: { permission: 'food.view' }`

## RTL & i18n
- `dir="rtl"` `lang="fa"`; use logical CSS (`inline-start`, `margin-inline`)
- Money: `formatMoney()`; digits in inputs: Persian allowed, store ASCII numbers
- Never pre-fill login credentials

## Lookups
- Use `useLookupsStore()` for accounts/cost-types/general-types dropdowns
- **PersonSelect:** search via `ApiPaths.lookups.persons`; resolve selected id via `ApiPaths.person(id)`
- Call `invalidate*` after mutating lookup data

## PWA
- Themes via `data-theme` on `<html>` (emerald, midnight, saffron, slate)
- Mobile breakpoint: 768px (`useIsMobile`)
